  "title": "Enterprise Bootstrap Theme",
  "description": "Components of the Enterprise Bootstrap Theme, plus the A2UI basic catalog's components and functions, which this catalog re-exports. Every data property accepts a literal or a {\"path\": …} binding. For each event a component emits, it has a binding property it writes each emission to, and an on<Event> action property. Bind the first to a path and read that path in the action's context; the context is resolved after the write.\n\n- ChatDock: ChatDock.\n- GraphLegend: Graph Legend.\n- OrientationPicker: Orientation Picker.\n- Ruler: Ruler.\n- SkeletonLoader: Skeleton Loader.\n- ToolColorPicker: Tool Color Picker.\n- WorkspaceShell: WorkspaceShell.",
